      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790467200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Every Space works on one cell, a question × a partition; here QW1 × F.\n2. Insight and Evidence run work, so their lower panel is Runs.\n3. Scope, Check and Delivery hold a person's actions; that panel says no Run.\n4. Run Space lists every run on the board and writes nothing.\n5. A00 today: 29 Supporting receipts; no Page Writing or Page Evidence Run yet.",
      "originalText": "1. Every Space works on one cell, a question × a partition; here QW1 × F.\n2. Insight and Evidence run work, so their lower panel is Runs.\n3. Scope, Check and Delivery hold a person's actions; that panel says no Run.\n4. Run Space lists every run on the board and writes nothing.\n5. A00 today: 29 Supporting receipts; no Page Writing or Page Evidence Run yet.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
