      "updated": 1790467200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Pages are Markdown, one folder each: <ID>-<slug>/<ID>-<slug>.md.\n2. The registers own the cells; a page only answers one.\n3. A page cites a run by its path; a run never edits a page.\n4. Actions leave a row in a page; Runs leave a runtime.yaml.",
      "originalText": "1. Pages are Markdown, one folder each: <ID>-<slug>/<ID>-<slug>.md.\n2. The registers own the cells; a page only answers one.\n3. A page cites a run by its path; a run never edits a page.\n4. Actions leave a row in a page; Runs leave a runtime.yaml.",
