      "updated": 1790467200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Five steps are Runs (one Supporting, four Page Writing); three are a person's actions.\n2. Each Page Writing Run ends with a person's Accept before the page changes.\n3. On A00 only step 2 left a receipt; steps 3 – 6 were written in chat sessions.\n4. The first _runs/insight/ Workflow Runtime gives steps 3 – 6 their run identity.\n5. Steps 7 and 8 wait for you: GI5 is held, so the QW1 handoff is stale.",
      "originalText": "1. Five steps are Runs (one Supporting, four Page Writing); three are a person's actions.\n2. Each Page Writing Run ends with a person's Accept before the page changes.\n3. On A00 only step 2 left a receipt; steps 3 – 6 were written in chat sessions.\n4. The first _runs/insight/ Workflow Runtime gives steps 3 – 6 their run identity.\n5. Steps 7 and 8 wait for you: GI5 is held, so the QW1 handoff is stale.",
